1
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:06,375
Who?

2
00:00:12,041 --> 00:00:14,791
The Godfather of the Sovereign Sanctum.

3
00:00:14,791 --> 00:00:16,666
The Godfather?

4
00:00:17,625 --> 00:00:19,000
What do you want?

5
00:00:19,166 --> 00:00:21,666
I hear you’ve issued a death threat

6
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:24,166
to the Four Great Families.

7
00:00:24,166 --> 00:00:26,875
Golantis is under my protection.

8
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:29,541
You overreach, Godfather.

9
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:33,250
You take the righteous
path, we walk in blood.

10
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,625
We don't interfere.

11
00:00:35,625 --> 00:00:38,375
You push me, you'll regret it.

12
00:00:38,375 --> 00:00:41,500
So you want to
declare war on me?

13
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,291
Fine!

14
00:00:47,291 --> 00:00:49,291
Then war it is!

15
00:00:50,125 --> 00:00:51,541
As you wish.

16
00:00:51,875 --> 00:00:55,375
Advance the attack on
the Four Great Families immediately!

17
00:00:55,375 --> 00:00:58,500
And declare war
on the Sovereign Sanctum!

18
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:07,125
The Black Dragon Covenant
won’t let this go.

19
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:09,375
Then let him try.

20
00:01:17,291 --> 00:01:19,291
Activate maximum protocol.

21
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:20,916
Exterminate every member of

22
00:01:20,916 --> 00:01:22,625
the Black Dragon Covenant.

23
00:01:22,625 --> 00:01:25,041
Mobilize one hundred thousand Holy
Knights

24
00:01:25,041 --> 00:01:26,541
to strike their stronghold.

25
00:01:26,750 --> 00:01:29,125
Lock onto the Black Dragon's location.

26
00:01:29,125 --> 00:01:31,541
I'm taking his head personally.

27
00:01:33,041 --> 00:01:34,666
Don't be afraid.
I'm here.

28
00:01:35,916 --> 00:01:37,541
You’re going yourself?

29
00:01:37,750 --> 00:01:39,416
He's too strong.

30
00:01:39,416 --> 00:01:40,875
Only I can handle him.

31
00:01:42,375 --> 00:01:43,625
Calm the guests.

32
00:01:43,625 --> 00:01:44,750
I'll be back soon.

33
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:50,791
My lord, I’ll be
waiting for our wedding night.

34
00:01:51,875 --> 00:01:53,125
Be ready.

35
00:01:53,125 --> 00:01:55,375
Our child will be a legend.

36
00:02:08,166 --> 00:02:10,125
My lord.
